column5:
update API and tests

- expose `ema_model` as an attribute;

- append `ema_momentum` to `Engine.state`;

- add test to test if buffers of `ema_model` are also synchronized.

Signed-off-by: sandylaker <yawei.li@tum.de>

improve API and cover the case of multiple EMA handlers.

- use `detach_` instead of `no_grad`;

- remove `state.ema_momentum` from `State` class;

- list public attributes;

- add `..version:: 0.5.0` tag;

- rename `momentum_warmup` and `momentum` to `momentum_start` and `momentum_end`, respectively;

- improve `attach` to allow for multiple EMA handlers being attached to the same engine.

Signed-off-by: sandylaker <yawei.li@tum.de>

Convert all const RosMessageNames to inherited readonly properties

Using Regex
Replace all 
public const string RosMessageName = "([^"]+)";
with
public string RosMessageName => "$1";
